\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Awake, awake to love and work,
\par The lark is in the sky,
\par The fields are wet with diamond dew,
\par The worlds awake to cry
\par Their blessings on the Lord of Life,
\par As He goes meekly by.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Come, let thy voice be one with theirs,
\par Shout with their shout of praise;
\par See how the giant soars up,
\par Great Lord of years and days!
\par So let the love of Jesus come,
\par And set thy soul ablaze.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. To give and give, and give again,
\par What God hath given thee;
\par To spend thy self nor count the cost,
\par To serve right gloriously
\par The God who gave all worlds that are,
\par And all that are to be.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

